#. Unlock
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The primary action.
msgid "unlockSync.unlock"
msgstr "Desbloquear"

#. Start over
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. Opens the confirmation that replaces the sync key; the second action beside Unlock.
msgid "unlockSync.startOver"
msgstr "Empezar de cero"

#. macos: Start Over
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "unlockSync.startOver"
msgstr "Empezar de cero"

#. That code isn't right. Check it and try again.
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. Shown under the field when the code's check characters fail or the server refuses it.
msgid "unlockSync.invalid"
msgstr "Ese código no es correcto. Revísalo e inténtalo de nuevo."

#. Couldn't unlock. Check your connection and try again.
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The unlock request failed for a reason other than the code.
msgid "unlockSync.failed"
msgstr "No se pudo desbloquear. Comprueba tu conexión e inténtalo de nuevo."

#. Couldn't start over. Check your connection and try again.
#. UnlockSync: Start over failed (not an unlock failure); Try again repeats it.
msgid "unlockSync.startOverFailed"
msgstr "No se pudo empezar de nuevo. Comprueba tu conexión e inténtalo de nuevo."

#. This account has no recovery code. On a device that's still signed in and unlocked, choose New recovery code. Otherwise, start over.
#. UnlockSync: the account has no recovery code, so unlocking cannot work; Start over is the way on.
msgid "unlockSync.noCode"
msgstr "Esta cuenta no tiene código de recuperación. En un dispositivo que siga con la sesión iniciada y desbloqueado, elige «Nuevo código de recuperación». Si no, empieza de nuevo."

#. Start over?
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The confirmation's title.
msgid "unlockSync.startOverTitle"
msgstr "¿Empezar de cero?"

#. Your current synced data will be lost. Start over only if you can't find your recovery code.
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The warning on the confirmation: a new sync key leaves the data under the old key unreadable (T22).
msgid "unlockSync.startOverWarning"
msgstr "Se perderán tus datos sincronizados actuales. Empieza de cero solo si no encuentras tu código de recuperación."

#. Start over
#. UnlockSync: unlock the synced data with the recovery code (U-42). Nearby unlock does not ship in v0.10.0, so no string offers it. The confirmation's destructive action.
msgid "unlockSync.startOverConfirm"
msgstr "Empezar de cero"

#. macos: Start Over
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "unlockSync.startOverConfirm"
msgstr "Empezar de cero"

#. Save your recovery code
#. RecoveryCode: shows the new recovery code once (U-42). The code itself is never copy.
msgid "recoveryCode.title"
msgstr "Guarda tu código de recuperación"

#. You'll need it to unlock your synced data on a new device. It's shown only once.
#. RecoveryCode: shows the new recovery code once (U-42). The code itself is never copy.
msgid "recoveryCode.lede"
msgstr "Lo necesitarás para desbloquear tus datos sincronizados en un dispositivo nuevo. Solo se muestra una vez."

#. No one will ever ask for this code. Enter it only in the app.
#. RecoveryCode: shows the new recovery code once (U-42). The code itself is never copy. Also shown by UnlockSync (T23): never entered on a web page, in an email or to a person.
msgid "recoveryCode.noAsk"
msgstr "Nadie te pedirá nunca este código. Introdúcelo solo en la app."

#. Copy code
#. RecoveryCode: shows the new recovery code once (U-42). The code itself is never copy.
msgid "recoveryCode.copy"
msgstr "Copiar código"

#. macos: Copy Code
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "recoveryCode.copy"
msgstr "Copiar código"

#. I've saved my recovery code
#. RecoveryCode: shows the new recovery code once (U-42). The code itself is never copy. A checkbox; Done is hidden until it is checked.
msgid "recoveryCode.saved"
msgstr "He guardado mi código de recuperación"

#. Your sync key changed
#. RingChange: confirm a changed sync key (U-42).
msgid "ringChange.title"
msgstr "Tu clave de sincronización ha cambiado"

#. {device} set up a new key for your synced data.
#. RingChange: confirm a changed sync key (U-42). Arguments: {device} = the name of the device that set the key up (changed.by), as the kit shows device names.
msgid "ringChange.body"
msgstr "{device} configuró una clave nueva para tus datos sincronizados."

#. A device set up a new key for your synced data.
#. RingChange: confirm a changed sync key (U-42). Used when no device is named.
msgid "ringChange.bodyUnknown"
msgstr "Un dispositivo configuró una clave nueva para tus datos sincronizados."

#. Choose “That was me” only if you did this. If not, use your recovery code.
#. RingChange: confirm a changed sync key (U-42).
msgid "ringChange.warning"
msgstr "Elige «Fui yo» solo si lo hiciste tú. Si no, usa tu código de recuperación."

#. Unlock with your recovery code to keep syncing.
#. RingChange: used when no ring was served, so there is nothing to accept.
msgid "ringChange.warningNoServed"
msgstr "Desbloquea con tu código de recuperación para seguir sincronizando."

#. Couldn't confirm the new key. Try again, or use your recovery code.
#. RingChange: accepting the new key failed; That was me stays available to retry.
msgid "ringChange.failed"
msgstr "No se pudo confirmar la nueva clave. Inténtalo de nuevo o usa tu código de recuperación."

#. That was me
#. RingChange: confirm a changed sync key (U-42). Passes the ring that was shown (changed.served) to acceptRingChange.
msgid "ringChange.accept"
msgstr "Fui yo"

#. macos: That Was Me
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "ringChange.accept"
msgstr "Fui yo"

#. Use recovery code
#. RingChange: confirm a changed sync key (U-42). Opens UnlockSync.
msgid "ringChange.useCode"
msgstr "Usar código de recuperación"

#. macos: Use Recovery Code
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "ringChange.useCode"
msgstr "Usar código de recuperación"

